{title: Awargi}
{artist: Ghulam Ali}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]ye dil ye pagal dil mera
[Am]kyon bujh [F]gaya aawargi
[Gm]is dasht mein ik shahar tha
[F]vo kya [Dm]hua aawargi
[Dm]kal shab mujhe be-shakl ki
[Dm]aawaaz [F]ne [C]chaunka [Dm]diya
[Dm]main ne kaha tu kaun hai
[F]usne [Dm]kahaa aawargi
[Dm]yeh dard ki tanhhaiyan
[Dm]yeh [F]dasht [C]ka [Dm]veran safar
[Dm]hum log to uqtaa gaye
[F]apni [Dm]suna aawargi
[Dm]logon bhala us shehar me
[Dm]kaise [F]jeyain [C]hum [Dm]jahan
[Dm]ho jurm tanha sochna
[F]lekin [Dm]saza awargi
[Dm]ik ajnabi jhonke ne jab
[Dm]pucha [F]mere [C]gam [Dm]ka sabab
[Dm]sahara ki bheegi rait par
[F]main ne [Dm]likha aawargi
[Dm]kal ratt tanha chand ko
[Dm]dekha [F]tha main [C]ne [Dm]khawab main
[Dm]mohsin mujhay rass aye gi
[F]shayad [Dm]sada aawargi
